flowchart LR
    R[Request] --> Q{Warm instance?}
    Q -->|yes| W[Handler only: 5-50ms]
    Q -->|no| P[Provision sandbox]
    P --> RT[Load runtime + bundle]
    RT --> INIT[Run init code]
    INIT --> H[Handler]
    M[Mitigations] -.->|smaller bundle| RT
    M -.->|lazy init| INIT
    M -.->|provisioned concurrency| Q
